{bpm: 100} {time: 3/4} {key: La}

// European (Solfege) Notation Reference
//
// European: Do  Re  Mi  Fa  Sol La  Si
// American: C   D   E   F   G   A   B
//
// Don Quixote's Dream - inspired by Cervantes

// ===== BASIC EUROPEAN NOTATION =====
{label: intro}
Lam         Sol         Do          Mi          // La minor, Sol, Do, Mi
In a village of La Mancha, the name of which
Fa          Do          Mi          Lam         // Fa, Do, Mi, La minor
I have no desire to recall...

// ===== MAJOR VS MINOR =====
// Uppercase root = Major, lowercase or 'm' suffix = minor
Do          Sol         Lam         Mim         // Do major, Sol major, La minor, Mi minor
There lived not long ago one of those gentlemen
Fa          Rem         Sol         Do          // Fa major, Re minor, Sol major, Do
That keep a lance in the lance-rack.

// ===== SEVENTH CHORDS =====
{label: verse1}
Domaj7      Lam7        Rem7        Sol7        // Major 7, minor 7, dominant 7
An old shield, a lean hack, and a greyhound for coursing.
Famaj7      Sim7b5      Mi7         Lam7        // Fmaj7, Bm7b5, E7, Am7
A pot of rather more beef than mutton.

// ===== ACCIDENTALS =====
{label: verse2}
Do#m        Reb         Fa#         Solb        // Sharps and flats with #/b
He became so absorbed in his books
Do♯m        Re♭         Fa♯         Sol♭        // Unicode sharps ♯ and flats ♭
That he spent his nights from sunset to sunrise.

// ===== ACCENTED VOWELS (Regional variants) =====
Dó          Ré          Fá          Lá          // Accented: Dó=Do, Ré=Re, Fá=Fa, Lá=La
Poring over them until his brains dried up,
dó          ré          fá          lá          // Lowercase accented = minor
And he lost the use of his reason.

// ===== EXTENDED CHORDS =====
{label: bridge}
Do9         Sol9        Lam9        Mi9         // 9th chords
He was filled with a desire to go out
Fa11        Re11        Sol13       Do          // 11th, 13th chords
To roam the world on horseback.

// ===== SLASH CHORDS =====
Do/Mi       Lam/Do      Rem/Fa      Sol/Si      // Inversions
Righting every manner of wrong,
Do/Sol      Fa/La       Sol/Re      Do          // More slash chords
And exposing himself to peril and danger.

// ===== DIMINISHED & AUGMENTED =====
{bpm: 90}
Dodim       Do°         Ladim7      La°7        // Diminished
To right the unrightable wrong,
Doaug       Do+         Miaug7      Mi+7        // Augmented
To fight the unbeatable foe!

// ===== SUSPENDED =====
Dosus4      Dosus2      Solsus4     Solsus2     // Suspended chords
To bear with unbearable sorrow,
Fasus4      Resus4      Solsus4     Do          // More suspensions
To run where the brave dare not go!

// ===== DURATION =====
{label: chorus}
Do*2        Sol*2       Lam*4                   // Hold for beats
Dream the impossible dream,
Fa*2        Mi*2        Lam*4                   // 2 beats, 2 beats, 4 beats
Fight the unbeatable foe.

// ===== TEMPO CHANGES =====
{bpm: +30}
Do          Sol         Lam         Fa
To try when your arms are too weary,

{bpm: reset}
Do          Sol         Do
To reach the unreachable star!

// ===== LOOPS =====
{loop: chorus 2}

// ===== FINALE =====
{label: outro}
Lam*2       Mi*2        Lam         NC*2        Lam*4
And the world... will be better... for this.

